Package: jarvis-workspace
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: xdg-utils
Recommends: git
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Jarvis Workspace: coding agents, editor and terminals in one window
 The Jarvis desktop app on @DISTRO_NAME@: coding agents in real terminals,
 an editor, and database, API and cluster tabs. It runs its own core, separate
 from the Jarvis assistant of the desktop, and reads the assistant's provider
 settings only if you allow it.
 Optional; not installed by default.
